    "detailedMergeStatus": "NOT_APPROVED",
    "autoMergeEnabled": false,
    "description": "Closes #128.\n\nManifest lookups hit the registry on every request. This adds a 30s\nTTL cache keyed by digest, cutting cold-path latency from ~180ms to ~12ms.\n\nNot cached: signature verification, which must stay live.",
